         patched keyboard (phase 3), ships an empty X509TrustManager. It is in the library, not in
         Pesto's code, and the patcher uses it to sign APKs, not for network traffic. -->
    <issue id="TrustAllX509TrustManager" severity="ignore" />
</lint>
